All AI-generated code and instructions were reviewed and run by the project owner.

## Known limitations

- Customers do not have accounts. They book with a name, phone and email.
- Confirmation emails are copied from the admin screen and sent manually. Automatic email needs an email service.
- Online payment is not processed. Customers pay in cash or by transfer using the details the admin enters.
- Supabase's free email sender is limited to a few emails per hour, which affects Forgot password.
